WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 66)

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.360
Aku kasih 2 pilihan 

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.680
Pertama, kamu juga pertaruhkan nyawa

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:04.600
Kedua

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.200
tinggalkan satu tanganmu

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.240
Aku gak mau!

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.680
Kamu masuk tanpa izin

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.600
Cari masalah denganku

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.280
Gak hormat 
pada Grup Saga 

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.160
Bawa plakat kesetiaan

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.840
tapi sengaja salah tulis

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.080
Tandi sudah menanggung akibatnya

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:22.680
Kamu?

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.520
Wino!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:23.840
Ya!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.520
Dia gak mau melakukannya 

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.800
Kalau begitu, bantu dia!

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.360
Baik!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.720
Tolong aku Kakak!

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.120
Kakak, tolong aku!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:33.920
Tuan Linken

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.680
kelakuanmu ini 
sudah keterlaluan 

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.840
Kenapa? Kamu mau gantikan dia?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.840
Ah gak, gak, gak 

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.960
Kalau begitu, diam!

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.040
Hahaha Tuan Linken

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.080
Aku salah 
aku tahu aku salah 

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.760
Klan Jana, bersedia 
jadi budak Grup Saga 

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.600
dan akan patuh pada Klan Dara dan Saga

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:57.480
Benarkan?

